9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":13198400136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAADEq-aiA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/audit:complete","name":"audit:complete","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"PR fully implemented spawning issue","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-11-14T11:55:55Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:30:29Z","closed_at":"2026-11-14T11:56:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/9967","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/9967","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/9967.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/9967.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-14T11:56:56Z"},"body":"Design decision record for #5843 (knowledge-layer extensibility cluster), following the sibling pattern of #5844 / PR #7906. Design only — no code changed.\n\nEvidence base: the #6435 feature matrix (`doc/knowledge-layer-feature-matrix-6435.md`, PR #7887 merged), §5 #5843 findings. The prerequisite that blocked the earlier packet (task 12818) has cleared: #6435 closed completed 2026-11-09 with the matrix on main.\n\nDecisions recorded in `doc/knowledge-layer-extensibility-5843.md`:\n1. **API first — ADOPT** a local, token-authenticated API over the corpus as the first extensibility surface (Joplin/Anytype shape); one contract for plugins, importers, and AI tools/MCP. Tokens are scoped, revocable, expiring capabilities; per-object reach still resolves through #5678's ruled read-authority order.\n2. **Plugins — ADAPT** declarative, capability-scoped registration against that API; Joplin-style plugin-registered import/export modules adopted for the importer line (#6436, #6438). In-process arbitrary-code community plugins (Obsidian shape) rejected for v1 with the door explicitly kept open via the registration/capability model.\n3. **Embeds/transclusion** — references resolved through the reader's read-authority decision at render time, never copies; denied embeds render an existence-only tombstone (the #5837 no-leak floor; #5844's per-object rule).\n4. **Scripting/automation** — automations are API clients under a named, auditable identity (Notion automations/webhooks shape, adapted local-first); no privileged built-in scripting runtime.\n\nEnterprise-only API tier (NotebookLM) and hosted-only sole surface rejected with reasons. Seven implementation invariants recorded. Parent decisions preserved; nothing re-decided.\n\nCloses #5843 on merge.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1797249358&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=9967&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F9967&signature=a44057165ef8e092141c977423b06409b5c09e4de8c16174a45e39bef64b48f5\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-